OL,3,ALondon mayor's untaxed car conviction
OL,4,Awithdrawn
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe DVLA has said a criminal
OL,7,Fprosecution against mayor of London Sir
OL,8,FSadiq Khan will be withdrawn after he
OL,9,Fwas convicted of not taxing a
OL,10,F24-year-old Nissan Micra.
OL,12,FThe Labour politician, 55, was found
OL,13,Fguilty of keeping an unlicensed vehicle
OL,14,Fby a magistrate last month in a
OL,15,Fcriminal prosecution brought by the
OL,16,FDVLA.
OL,18,FCourt documents show letters addressed
OL,19,Fto the mayor about the unpaid tax bill
OL,20,Fwere sent to Gordon Ramsay's east
OL,21,FLondon restaurant and the car did not
OL,22,Fbelong to the mayor.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
