OL,3,ALondon mayor's untaxed car conviction
OL,4,Awithdrawn
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the mayor said:
OL,7,F"This is a scam, which is a crime. It's
OL,8,Fnot the first time the mayor has been
OL,9,Fvictim of a scam involving people
OL,10,Ffalsely stating that Sadiq is the owner
OL,11,Fof a vehicle."
